/-!
# True values of the low-resolution family pipeline of the `μ > 0` passing guiding-centre torus

The value `XLM c u z i` of each variable of the low-resolution family ball pipeline at the
parameter `w = c` (pitch parameter `λ = lamF c = (1 + Re c)/8 ∈ [0, 1/4]`, gyro-length
`ρ₀ = 1/256`) and a torus `(u, z)`: the values `XL u z i` of the `ρ = 1/256`, `μ = 0` pipeline
(`Design/RationalStellaratorGCTorusRelL`) for the variables that do not depend on `λ`, and the
parameter `r = 63 + 8λ`, the nodes of `|B|`, `(1 − λ|B|)^{−1/2}`, the scalar `F` and the
`μ > 0` flow form `gcFlowMu (1/256) λ` for the new variables. The identity of every node,
`c' · X n = eval X e` (`relLM_*`): by congruence from `relL_*` for the `λ`-independent nodes
(`rel_congr`), proved pointwise on the torus (`ext_eval`) by `ring` for the new ones.
Generated by `scripts/gc_kam/lam_emit_lean.py`.
-/

